WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.575
To use a formula, replace each letter with its value.

2
00:00:04.402 --> 00:00:09.177
P equals two l plus two w, with l as three and w as two.

3
00:00:09.932 --> 00:00:13.607
Two l means two times l, so write in the times signs.

4
00:00:14.508 --> 00:00:18.583
Two times three, plus two times two, is six plus four: ten.

5
00:00:20.931 --> 00:00:25.781
New values, same formula: two times four plus two times two is twelve.
